{title: Chaudhvin Ka Chaand Ho}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Ravi}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G],        Chaudhvi ka chand ho ya aftab ho
[G] [D],        Jo bhi ho tum, khuda ki qasam,
[G],        lajavab ho
[G],        Zulfen hain jaise kandhe pe
[C] [G],        badal jhuke hue
[G],        Ankhen hain jaise meay ke
[C] [G],        payale bhare hue
[C] [D],        Masti hai jis me pyaar ki tum,
[G],        vo sharab ho
[G],        Chehra hai jaise jheel me
[C] [D],        khilata hua kanval
[G],        Ya zindagi ke saaj pe
[C] [G],        chhedi hui gazal
[C] [D],        Jane bahar tum kisi
[D] [G],        shayar ka khwab ho
[G],        Honthon pe khelti hain
[C] [G],        tabassum ki bijliyan
[G],        Sajade tumhaari raah men
[C] [G],        karti hain kehkashan
[C] [D],        Duniya-e-husn-o-ishq ka
[D] [G],        tum hi shabab ho
